# VS Code / Search Tool Exclusion Configuration
# Keeps workspace search scoped to project configs, scripts, and custom modules while excluding heavy upstream sources and dumps.

# Exclude heavy upstream source and runtime caches/tools
odoo-base/**
.mypy_cache/**
.antigravitycli/**
.kilocode/**
.kilo/**
.vscode/**
deployments/**/.secrets/**
*.tar*
*.sql
*.dump
*.swp

# Explicitly include operational directories
!conf/
!conf/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!utilities/
!utilities/**
!deployments/
!deployments/**
!git/
!git/**
!.env*
!*.md
